{"4866150":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Pluricubus","steam_appid":4866150,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through puzzling levels by rotating a polycube in different directions.  Try to get to the exit on each level, but don't fall off the edge!  Different tiles have special effects: some restrict your movement, crumble away, or  add and remove cubes.  Some levels have multiple separate polycubes which are controlled simultaneously.  Others take place in 3D, allowing movement along walls or ceilings as well.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 sets of levels, with a total of over 200 unique puzzles!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in level editor, so you can craft your own levels and share them with your friends.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each level, your best time and most efficient solution are kept track of.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different environments and distinct visual themes, each with a corresponding original soundtrack.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Trial mode, where you try to complete as many levels as possible with limited time.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Fix mode, where some tiles in each level are taken away for you to place back more efficiently.  Upon victory, you are given a score based on how many of these tiles remain.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through puzzling levels by rotating a polycube in different directions.  Try to get to the exit on each level, but don't fall off the edge!  Different tiles have special effects: some restrict your movement, crumble away, or  add and remove cubes.  Some levels have multiple separate polycubes which are controlled simultaneously.  Others take place in 3D, allowing movement along walls or ceilings as well.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 sets of levels, with a total of over 200 unique puzzles!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in level editor, so you can craft your own levels and share them with your friends.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each level, your best time and most efficient solution are kept track of.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different environments and distinct visual themes, each with a corresponding original soundtrack.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Trial mode, where you try to complete as many levels as possible with limited time.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Fix mode, where some tiles in each level are taken away for you to place back more efficiently.  Upon victory, you are given a score based on how many of these tiles remain.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A puzzle game about using rotation to move. Pass through complex levels, making use of special tiles along the way. Teleport, change shape, move along walls and ceilings, and sometimes control multiple shapes at once to reach the end.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4866150\/8229e77af0a8f4ef3ae266bb42060fcc8665dc32\/header.jpg?t=1793674550","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4866150\/cd3da3a325a21e048daef7ce78e8047d8f60979b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793674550","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4866150\/cd3da3a325a21e048daef7ce78e8047d8f60979b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793674550","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPUs<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Monterey 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple Silicon, x64 architecture with SSE2<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 22.04, Ubuntu 24.04<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.2+, Vulkan capable GPUs<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Integral Horse Domain"],"publishers":["Integral Horse Domain"],"demos":[{"appid":5280190,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":489,"final":489,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"4,89€"},"packages":[1689980],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Pluricubus","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1689980,"percent_savings